OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects call to bar
OL,4,Amigrant landings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortsmouth City Council has voted
OL,7,Fagainst a motion calling for the city
OL,8,Fto never be used to land migrants
OL,9,Frescued from small boats.
OL,11,FCouncillors voted 24 to 13, with one
OL,12,Fabstention, to reject the proposal,
OL,13,Fwhich followed the arrival of 120
OL,14,Fpeople at Eastney on 6 September.
OL,16,FThe motion, proposed by Reform
OL,17,Fcouncillor George Madgwick, said
OL,18,FPortsmouth was "not a suitable
OL,19,Fdisembarkation point" for small boat
OL,20,Farrivals and "must not be permitted to
OL,21,Fbecome one".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
