OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects call to bar
OL,4,Amigrant landings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA letter from the Home Office and
OL,7,FDepartment for Transport, read to the
OL,8,Fmeeting, said it was "not the
OL,9,Fgovernment's intention" to make
OL,10,FPortsmouth a routine landing site, but
OL,11,Fstopped short of ruling it out
OL,12,Fentirely.
